  "observations": [
    "The two phones show an identifiable pearl/teal wake throughout sustained ordinary crossings. Broken crests reduce the earlier continuous parallel-rail appearance.",
    "Curved historical sections remain behind in world space while the visible ferry advances and changes heading; both travel directions remain coherent.",
    "Bow/stern contact stays localized around the visible hull, and soft residual arcs broaden/fade after the arrival controls become available.",
